{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06935","headline":"空灵山应田叟 · 常建","name":"空灵山应田叟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖南无村落，山舍多黄茆。\n淳朴如太古，其人居鸟巢。\n牧童唱巴歌，野老亦献嘲。\n泊舟问溪口，言语皆哑咬。\n土俗不尚农，岂暇论肥硗。\n莫傜射禽兽，浮客烹鱼鲛。\n余亦罘罝人，获麋今尚苞。\n敬君中国来，愿以充其庖。\n日入闻虎鬬，空山满咆哮。\n怀人虽共安，异域终难交。\n白水可洗心，采薇可爲肴。\n曳策背落日，江风鸣梢梢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}